      "node_type": "function",
      "name": "_auto_adjust_word_counts",
      "line_number": 848,
      "docstring": "Auto-adjust word distribution across sections to fit 982-1082 range.\n\nConstraints:\n- Exec summary: 100-150 words (hard constraint)\n- Unify/IBM ratio: 1.1-1.4 (Unify words / IBM words)\n- EY & early_career: flexible if signal improves materially\n- Frozen sections (name, headline): cannot change\n\nLogic:\n- If total < 982: expand lower sections while maintaining signal\n- If total > 1082: trim higher sections while maintaining signal",
